# api/

API client surface for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Endpoint-shaped wrappers around
`fetch`, typed against the response shapes defined in each feature/screen's
`types/` folder.

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`client.ts`](client.ts) | Shared fetch wrapper — base URL, headers, error normalisation. |

## What lives here

- One `*.api.ts` file per backend resource (`health.api.ts`, `users.api.ts`).
- The shared `client.ts` fetch wrapper (auth header injection, retry, etc.).

## What does NOT live here

- React hooks — those live in screen/feature `hooks/` folders.
- Mocks — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/tests/`.
- Caching strategy — TanStack Query owns that; this folder returns raw
  promises.

